\cf4 \cb1 Once I had completed the petri net design, I didn\'92t actually know how to start the code. Petri nets was a new concept and something that I had not coded before. I started by just adding the interface methods to interlockingImpl but after that did not really know where to start. "I am having trouble implementing my petri net design and I do not know where to start, can you give me a few ideas without giving me any code."\
\'a0\
It explained there were multiple ways of implementing the petri net, I could literally implement the petri net with places, transition and tokens or I could just keep track of where each train is and which sections it could move to. I decided to go with the second option because it seemed like the simpler alternative and coding all of the places and transitions seemed like it was inefficient way of doing it. Because of this decision it said I should start with keeping track of the places and if a train is on a place. \
\uc0\u8232 I then later updated the planning doc to include the steps of what I thought needed to happen next.
